## 2. Color System

### Primary Palette

#### Brand Purple (Primary Accent)
The signature color representing transparency, clarity, and civic intelligence.

| Token | Light Mode | Dark Mode | Usage |
|-------|------------|-----------|-------|
| `--bright-purple` | `#ad35fa` | `#c44dff` | Primary buttons, active states, links, focus rings |
| `--accent-hover` | `#9625e0` | `#ad35fa` | Hover states on purple elements |
| `--secondary-purple` | `#8B5CF6` | `#a78bfa` | Secondary accents, subtle highlights |

```css
/* CSS Implementation */
:root {
    --bright-purple: #ad35fa;
    --accent-hover: #9625e0;
    --secondary-purple: #8B5CF6;
}

[data-theme="dark"] {
    --bright-purple: #c44dff;
    --accent-hover: #ad35fa;
    --secondary-purple: #a78bfa;
}
```

#### Semantic Colors

| Token | Light Mode | Dark Mode | Usage |
|-------|------------|-----------|-------|
| `--ink-black` | `#222222` | `#ffffff` | Primary text, logos |
| `--warm-coral` | `#FF6B5A` | `#FF6B5A` | Errors, alerts, danger, negative change |
| `--cloud-gray` | `#E8E9EB` | `#2a2a2a` | Borders, dividers, inactive states |
| `--soft-sand` | `#F6F1EA` | `#1a1a1a` | Secondary backgrounds, cards |
| `--sky-blue` | `#71B2CA` | `#71B2CA` | Informational, chart accents |
| `--sky-tint` | `#B8D8E3` | `#1e3a47` | Light blue backgrounds |
| `--spruce-green` | `#4A7463` | `#4A7463` | Success, positive change, chart accents |

