## 3. Typography

### Font Stack

#### Display & Headings
**Inter** — Modern, clean geometric sans-serif optimized for screen readability.

```css
font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
```

#### Body Text
**IBM Plex Sans** — Humanist sans-serif designed for clarity in dense information layouts.

```css
font-family: 'IBM Plex Sans', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
```

### Type Scale

| Level | Font | Weight | Size | Line Height | Usage |
|-------|------|--------|------|-------------|-------|
| H1 | Inter | 700 (Bold) | 36px | 42px | Page titles |
| H2 | Inter | 600 (Semi) | 24px | 32px | Section headers |
| H3 | Inter | 500 (Medium) | 18px | 28px | Card titles, panel headers |
| H4 | Inter | 500 (Medium) | 14px | 22px | Subsection headers |
| Body | IBM Plex Sans | 400 | 14px | 22px | Primary content |
| Body Small | IBM Plex Sans | 400 | 13px | 20px | Sidebar, compact layouts |
| Caption | IBM Plex Sans | 400 | 12px | 18px | Metadata, chart labels |
| Micro | IBM Plex Sans | 400 | 11px | 16px | Chart annotations, badges |
| Label | Inter | 600 | 12px | 16px | Form labels, section tags |

### Typography CSS

```css
/* Import fonts */
@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=IBM+Plex+Sans:wght@400;500;600&display=swap');

/* Type scale */
