## 4. Spacing System

Base unit: **4px**

| Token | Value | Usage |
|-------|-------|-------|
| `--space-1` | 4px | Micro gaps |
| `--space-2` | 8px | Related elements |
| `--space-3` | 12px | Component internal |
| `--space-4` | 16px | Section padding |
| `--space-5` | 20px | Card padding |
| `--space-6` | 24px | Section gaps |
| `--space-8` | 32px | Major sections |
| `--space-10` | 40px | Page margins |

### Component Spacing Guidelines

- **Cards/Panels**: 16px–20px internal padding
- **Button padding**: 10px vertical, 15px horizontal
- **Form inputs**: 12px padding
- **Sidebar items**: 4px vertical margin, 10px–15px horizontal padding
- **Section gaps**: 24px–32px

