## 5. Component Library

### Buttons

#### Primary Button (Purple)
```css
.btn-primary {
    background: var(--bright-purple);
    color: white;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 10px 16px;
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 500;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
}

.btn-primary:hover {
    background: var(--accent-hover);
    transform: scale(1.02);
}

.btn-primary:active {
    transform: scale(0.98);
}

.btn-primary:focus {
    outline: 2px solid var(--bright-purple);
    outline-offset: 2px;
}
```

#### Secondary Button (Outline)
```css
.btn-secondary {
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--bright-purple);
    border: 1px solid var(--bright-purple);
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 10px 16px;
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: 13px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
}

.btn-secondary:hover {
    background: rgba(173, 53, 250, 0.1);
}
```

#### Danger Button
```css
.btn-danger {
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--warm-coral);
    border: 1px solid var(--warm-coral);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--warm-coral);
}

.btn-danger:hover {
    background: rgba(255, 107, 90, 0.1);
}
```

#### Icon Button (Circular)
```css
.btn-icon {
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--bg-secondary);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-primary);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
}

.btn-icon:hover {
    background: var(--bg-tertiary);
    transform: scale(1.05);
}
```

### Sidebar Navigation

#### Navigation Item
```css
.sidebar button {
    display: block;
    width: 90%;
    margin: 4px auto;
    padding: 10px 15px;
    background: var(--cloud-gray);
    border: none;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--ink-black);
    border-radius: 4px;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    text-align: left;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Sans', sans-serif;
