## 7. Chart & Visualization Standards

### Chart Color Palette

Use these colors in order for multi-series charts:

1. `#ad35fa` — Bright Purple (primary series)
2. `#FF6B5A` — Warm Coral
3. `#71B2CA` — Sky Blue
4. `#4A7463` — Spruce Green
5. `#8B5CF6` — Secondary Purple
6. `#F6F1EA` — Soft Sand (backgrounds only)

### Chart Typography

```javascript
// Plotly.js configuration
const chartLayout = {
    font: {
        family: 'IBM Plex Sans, Arial, sans-serif',
        color: '#222222'
    },
    title: {
        font: {
            family: 'Inter, Arial, sans-serif',
            size: 14,
            weight: 600
        }
    },
    xaxis: {
        tickfont: {
            family: 'IBM Plex Sans, Arial, sans-serif',
            size: 9
        }
    },
    yaxis: {
        tickfont: {
            family: 'IBM Plex Sans, Arial, sans-serif',
            size: 9
        },
        title: {
            font: {
                family: 'IBM Plex Sans, Arial, sans-serif',
                size: 10
            }
        }
    },
    legend: {
        font: {
            family: 'IBM Plex Sans, Arial, sans-serif',
            size: 9
        }
    }
};
```

### Chart Container Constraints

- **Embedded/iframe mode**: Max width 600px
- **Full view**: Responsive, use available width
- **Aspect ratio**: 4:3 (75% padding-bottom) for time series charts
- **Margins**: Minimal in embedded mode (t:30, b:20, l:40, r:25)

### Chart Grid & Axes

```javascript
// Grid styling
gridcolor: 'rgba(232, 233, 235, 0.5)', // Light mode
// Dark mode: 'rgba(60, 60, 60, 0.5)'

showgrid: true, // Y-axis only
zeroline: false,

// Axis line
showline: true,
linecolor: '#e5e7eb',
linewidth: 1
```

### Anomaly Visualization

- **Normal range**: Fill with `rgba(74, 116, 99, 0.15)` (Spruce Green)
- **Historical data**: Line with `#ad35fa` (Bright Purple)
- **Recent data**: Same as historical for continuity
- **Connecting line**: Dotted style between periods

### Hover Labels

```javascript
hoverlabel: {
    bgcolor: 'var(--soft-sand, #F6F1EA)',
    bordercolor: 'var(--spruce-green, #4A7463)',
    font: {
        family: 'IBM Plex Sans, Arial, sans-serif',
        size: 9,
        color: '#222222'
    }
}
```

